  "brief": { "zh": "在风球杯的终场哨响时独占第一。留在场内拾取任一道具都能得一分，增幅和护盾芯片也计分。两台捡球手会抢道具，一台对抗机会追击芽芽。第 9 和 18 回合结束时未收走的风球换到场地另一侧。道具收完或第 38 回合结束时结算，芽芽停机会提前出局。", "en": "Hold first place outright at the final whistle. Every pickup scores one point, including power and shield chips. Two ball gatherers compete for pickups while a hunter chases Sprout. Unclaimed gustballs switch sides after turns 9 and 18. Scoring ends when items run out or after turn 38, and Sprout is out if powered down." },
